Spec: Authority epoch persistence and migration verification

Purpose:
  Prove review denials preserve live authority and schema upgrades never restore previously invalid grants.

Owns:
  ./AuthorityEpochTests.cs

Must:
  Remove newer connection journals when constructing older schema fixtures; migration must not invent flows or attachments.
  Remove newer access tables when constructing historical schema fixtures and verify the current schema version after migration.
  Exercise actual schema-five migration with valid and stale grant stamps and retain old operation results.
  Verify denial-only epoch preservation, approval/revocation invalidation and corrupt epoch refusal.
